# Every change needs the maintainer's eyes; these paths are called out because
# they are the trust boundary: the CLI that creates and removes managed
# worktrees and rewrites Git metadata, the installer, the collection README
# that setup writes into ~/Code, and CI itself. This file is informational on
# purpose. The merge gate is CI (strict required checks, conversation
# resolution, no force-push or deletion, admins included), matching
# intuitums/e and fschrhunt/flip.

*                     @fschrhunt

/bin/                 @fschrhunt
/lib/                 @fschrhunt
/install.sh           @fschrhunt
/scripts/             @fschrhunt
/.github/             @fschrhunt
/docs/reference/filesystem.md @fschrhunt
